graph TD
    User([User Prompt]) --> LoadContext[Load Context: Memory Loader]
    
    subgraph Brain [Omni-Agent Brain]
        LoadContext --> Planner{Planner: Plan-and-Execute}
        Planner -->|Generate Plan| Executor[Executor Loop]
        Executor -->|Action| Tools[External Tools / Data]
        Tools -->|Observation| Executor
        Executor -->|Step Completed| Reviewer{Reviewer: Self-Critique}
        Reviewer -->|Need Revision| Planner
    end
    
    subgraph Memory [Dual-Process Memory]
        MemEpisodic[(Episodic Memory: Recent Events)]
        MemSemantic[(Semantic Memory: Facts & Preferences)]
        
        LoadContext -.->|Read| MemEpisodic
        LoadContext -.->|Read| MemSemantic
        
        Finalizer -.->|Write| MemEpisodic
        Finalizer -.->|Write| MemSemantic
    end
    
    Reviewer -->|Approved| Finalizer[Finalizer: Memory Updater]
    Finalizer --> Output([Final Answer])

    style Brain fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Memory fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style User fill:#dfd
    style Output fill:#dfd
